OL,3,GNEWSAImprovements still needed at
OL,4,Ahigh-security hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA high-security psychiatric hospital
OL,7,Fhas been told it still needs to improve
OL,8,Fafter whistleblowers raised concerns
OL,9,Fabout safety and low staffing levels.
OL,11,FRampton Hospital, run by
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Healthcare NHS
OL,13,FFoundation Trust, has been rated
OL,14,F"requires improvement" by the Care
OL,15,FQuality Commission (CQC) following an
OL,16,Funannounced inspection in April.
OL,18,FLow staffing levels at Rampton had been
OL,19,Fa "long-standing concern" which the CQC
OL,20,Fsaid leaders had not got on top of
OL,21,Fafter two previous inspections.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
